{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e14a5c51-0c7a-8073-aea0-2980eea84d57",
  "created_at": "2025-12-19T14:48:21-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Tito Monteiro",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T14:44:07-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. Good afternoon, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T14:44:13-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi, good afternoon. I'm calling because of the water. After the soaker, Wednesday and Thursday, yesterday it ended, and now I got a mess in front of my house. No way this is normal."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T14:44:27-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm sorry about that. Tell me what you're seeing. Is it a storm drain, or the street itself?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T14:44:35-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The drain, the one at the curb. It's clogged, it's full of leaves and stuff, and the water doesn't go. It sits there. And then my driveway, the apron, you know the part where it meets the street? It holds a puddle, a big one, and it runs right toward the garage door. Right toward it!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T14:44:57-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the puddle collects at the bottom of the driveway and the slope sends it toward your garage door. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T14:45:07-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. Every time it rains hard, the same. And I keep telling myself somebody will come clean it and nobody comes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T14:45:16-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Has anyone from the city been out to that drain before, as far as you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T14:45:23-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not that I see. Maybe, I don't know. Nobody that I see in the years. I just see the leaves piling up every fall and then this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T14:45:34-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And is the water getting into the garage right now, or is it just pooling outside?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T14:45:41-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right now it's outside only, but it's close. And the sidewalk, oh my God, the sidewalk is a sheet of mud and grit. Everything washed down from the street and it sits there. You walk and you slide. No way an older person can walk there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T14:45:59-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That sounds slippery. So mud and grit across the sidewalk in front of the house, from the runoff."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T14:46:07-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. And this morning, I'm backing out, and there's a guy on a bike, he goes around the water, comes out in the street, and he almost clipped my mirror. Almost! Because he can't use the side, it's all mud, so he's in the road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T14:46:25-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Goodness, I'm glad nothing happened. That's a good reason to get it looked at quickly. Can I get the address where this is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T14:46:35-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, I would rather not say it on the phone right now, I'm in the car, the signal is bad. Can you just take my number and somebody calls me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T14:46:47-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do need a location to send a crew, so I'll need it when somebody calls you back. Let me take your name and a number, and I'll note everything you told me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T14:47:00-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Tito Monteiro. Monteiro, M-O-N-T-E-I-R-O. The number is four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-nine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T14:47:05-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tito Monteiro, 401-555-0199. Did I say that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T14:47:09-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, correct, that's it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T14:47:12-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. I have a clogged storm drain at the curb, standing water at the driveway apron running toward the garage door, mud and grit on the sidewalk, and a cyclist nearly hit your mirror this morning. I'll pass that to the crew supervisor today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T14:47:29-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. And please, when it's done, when they clean it, you call me back? I want to know it's finished, not just that somebody wrote it down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T14:47:40-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'll put a note to call you once it's done. With the rain this week they're likely working through a lot of drains, so it may take a few days, but you'll get the call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T14:47:54-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. A few days, okay. Just, no way I want this again next storm. It's the same every time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T14:48:02-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. I'll make a note of that as well. Anything else I can help with this afternoon?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T14:48:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's all. Thank you, Lorraine. Have a good weekend."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-19T14:48:15-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Mr. Monteiro. Drive safe, and watch out for that slick sidewalk."
    }
  ],
